<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.88 pct on Oct 4.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 1.88 pct on Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Monday liquidity in the bank system grew 1.88 percent, or 289 million sucres, to 15.64 billion sucres on October 4.</p>
<p>At the end of September, bank liquidity stood at 15.35 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1995 at 12.51 billion sucres, up 41.2 percent from 1994.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
